WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.680
(Episode 96) Are you okay?

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.880
For so many years,

3
00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.260
you have suffered because of me.

4
00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.960
Mom, don't say that.

5
00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:11.500
You are my mother.

6
00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:12.700
You love me and care for me.

7
00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.360
Shouldn't I treat you well?

8
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.160
Then,

9
00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:17.480
shouldn't you think about your

10
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.720
own happiness?

11
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.800
We should tell Mr. Bradley

12
00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.360
about our return.

13
00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:32.960
Let's wait a bit longer.

14
00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:34.980
Niko mentioned that he would be

15
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.260
attending a cocktail party tonight.

16
00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:38.800
I think this will be a

17
00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:40.280
good opportunity to surprise him.

18
00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:50.240
Mr. Bradley,

19
00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:51.040
cheers.

20
00:00:58.040 --> 00:00:59.160
This is Mr. Diaz.

21
00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:00.160
And that's Mr. Delgado.

22
00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:06.360
What a bastard!

23
00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:08.200
He finds a new love so quickly.
